  "question": {
    "text": "If $y=(1+x)\\left(1+x^2\\right)\\left(1+x^4\\right) \\ldots\\left(1+x^{2 n}\\right)$ then the value of $\\left(\\frac{d y}{d x}\\right)_{x=0}$ is",
