  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: T-log \\& Differentiate\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{d y}{d x}=y\\left[\\frac{1}{1+x}+\\frac{2 x}{1+x^2}+\\ldots\\right] \\text { Put } x=0 \\\\\n& \\frac{d y}{d x}=1\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
